class TestAToolThatHelpedMakeAPartOfTheChange(_TheToolsThatEachLineCredits, unittest.TestCase):
    """A line that begins with the tool followed by `helped me`, `helped us` or `helped to` and a
    verb of making, by a list of activities that goes on to a verb of making, or by help with the
    boilerplate or the comments, also in the sentence after a period, and a compound disclosure
    label, such as `AI usage disclosure:`, followed on the same line by the statement that the rows
    of a disclosure heading read below a heading. A list of activities that make nothing, a verb of
    making of the person or with the description as its object, a result after `helped, so` other
    than the comments, comments on a pull request and a label followed by a verb that describes the
    section of a document are not read, and neither is a verb of making in a noun pair, as in `the
    test and build failures`."""

