        "{tool} was used for the parser that I maintain and wrote its tests.",
        # A role of the tool before a part of the change, and a paragraph that gives the tool a part
        # of the change after a first sentence that only says that it was used.
        "AI disclosure: I used {tool} as a coding assistant to write the fix.",
        "## AI usage\n\nI used {tool} for this PR. It found the bug and wrote the fix.",
